<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0657_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Brock</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? I can’t hear you.\nThe connection trash.\rThere’s a rock in the way. A big one.\nI’d know. Call back!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup...\nWhat’s good?\fI’m doin’ great! Found a cool rock!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm... I’d like to scrap you again, but\nI think there’s Blocks you ain’t hit\fyet, ain’t there?\fGo on. The rocks’ll wait.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I can take a break Saturday evenings,\nif you wanna call again then.\fAfter my rock club meetin’. It’s me\fand two other guys.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you called at the right time!\nI’m free right now.\fWanna scrap me again? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, aight! I’m lookin’ forward to it!\rI’ll meet you at the Saffron Dojo!\rI WON’T be at the Pewter Block, aight?\nDon’t get confused! People do!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Is that so...\nWell, I guess you got a lotta stuff to\fdo yourself... I’ll be with my rocks.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yeah, I’d deadass like to scrap you\nagain... But you got plans with\fsomebody else?\rHandle your business with the other\nHustlers, then call me again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll be waitin’ for you at the Saffron\nDojo.\fIt’s a promise between Hustlers!\fSolid as a rock. Get it? ...Rock.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Brock.\nOh ayo, how you doin’?\fI’m holdin’ a rock right now.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We made plans to scrap at the Saffron\nDojo, right?\fYou ain’t forget, did you?\fI ain’t mad. Rocks don’t get mad.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A big earthquake hit recently.\nSome walls in my Block crumbled.\rWell, my Block is ALL rocks anyway.\rSo even if the walls crumbled,\nnobody would deadass notice!\fI noticed. I cried a lil.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s SO many kinds of homies.\nLike you could guess, I like Rock\ftypes best.\rSolid and rough, but kinda brittle\nat the same time.\fOnce you deadass get to know ’em,\fthey kinda cute.\rLike me! ...What you think?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Every town’s Block is different!\nThe design, the tricks, all of it!\rEvery Block Boss get to design their\nBlock however they want.\rPewter Block’s design is my pride and\njoy!\rThe tricks ain’t much, but when you\nwalk in, the ROCKS hit you HARD, right?\fSometimes literally. Watch your head.</language>
	</row>
</body>
